  "description": "Find the kth largest element in an unsorted array using the Quickselect algorithm.",
  "target": 5,
  "pseudocode": "1. pivot = array[high]\n2. i = low\n3. for j from low to high-1:\n4.   if array[j] <= pivot:\n5.     swap(array[i], array[j]), i++\n6. swap(array[i], array[high])\n7. return i",
