  "fullDescription": "<p>Given an integer array <code>nums</code> and an integer <code>k</code>, return <em>the</em> <code>k<sup>th</sup></code> <em>largest element in the array</em>.</p>\n\n<p>Note that it is the <code>k<sup>th</sup></code> largest element in the sorted order, not the <code>k<sup>th</sup></code> distinct element.</p>\n\n<p>Can you solve it without sorting?</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> nums = [3,2,1,5,6,4], k = 2\n<strong>Output:</strong> 5\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> nums = [3,2,3,1,2,4,5,5,6], k = 4\n<strong>Output:</strong> 4\n</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= k &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>4</sup> &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n"
